B.aHW=s(["Use Sync in the Labyrinth drawer to upload this device\u2019s current player save, including recipes, ingredients, notes, nutrition, theme settings, and progression, to the account that is currently signed in.","Wait for SYSTEM SYNC COMPLETE before relying on that upload to move your data to another device. A failure dialog means the cloud save was not confirmed; the local save remains on this device.","Sync uploads this device\u2019s data to the account; use it from the device that has the data you want to keep.","Sign into the same account on another device to restore its cloud save. Anonymous sign-ins are device/account specific and are not the same as a Google account.","The app also saves locally, so being offline can leave recent changes only on this device until a sync succeeds.","Google, email, and anonymous sign-in are supported. The first setup asks for a Monarch name, height, and weight.","Goal doc settings can store a Google Doc title and link. System Mail keeps notices and monthly audit reminders."],t.s)
B.b1q=new A.kb(B.y7,"ACCOUNT & MANUAL SYNC","Sign in to keep this device save in your Firebase account.",B.aM_,B.aHW)
